<title>CHINA: China forex interbank market to trade on Saturday.</title>
<headline>China forex interbank market to trade on Saturday.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The China Foreign Exchange Trade System, the national interbank market, will trade on Saturday before closing for four days for a National Day holiday, an exchange official said.</p>
<p>The market will close from Sunday to Wednesday and will resume trading on Thursday next week, the official said.</p>
